               <code code="51945-4" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="PACKAGE LABEL.PRINCIPAL DISPLAY PANEL"/>
               <title>Principal for Oxygen Product</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph/>
                  <paragraph/>
                  <paragraph>
                     <renderMultiMedia referencedObject="img_521bbad6-26c5-7c4b-e063-6394a90ae675"/>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>OXYGEN,
  <br/>
COMPRESSED USP
  <br/>
UN 1072
 </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>No Smoking No Vaping</paragraph>
                  <paragraph/>
                  <paragraph>DANGER:
  <br/>
HIGH PRESSURE OXIDIZING GAS.
  <br/>
VIGOROUSLY ACCELERATES COMBUSTION.
  <br/>
MAY CAUSE OR INTENSIFY FIRE. OXIDIZER.
  <br/>
MAY REACT VIOLENTLY.
 </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Keep away from oil, grease and all ignition sources.
  <br/>
Use and store only in well-ventilated areas.
  <br/>
Open valve slowly. Close after each use and when empty.
  <br/>
Use equipment rated for cylinder pressure.
  <br/>
Use in accordance with Safety Data Sheet instructions.
  <br/>
Do not use if damaged.
  <br/>
Keep cylinder secured in upright position.
  <br/>
Do not drop or allow to strike each other.
  <br/>
Do not refill this container.
  <br/>
Contents under pressure.
  <br/>
Use only with equipment cleaned for oxygen service.
 </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Federal law requires this device to be sold by or on the order of a physician.
  <br/>
Rx Required
 </paragraph>
